ially urgent, especially if the pain is current, worsening, pressure-like, spreading to the arm, back, jaw, or comes with sweating, dizziness, or nausea.\n\n**What to do now**\nIf this is happening **right now** or has happened recently and feels significant, seek **urgent in-person emergency evaluation now**. If the symptoms are active, do not stay alone, avoid exertion, and get immediate help.\n\n**Why I’m escalating this**\nStress and anxiety can sometimes cause chest discomfort and breathlessness, but they can also overlap with heart, lung, or blood-pressure-related problems that should not be missed from chat alone.\n\n**One quick question**\nAre the chest pain and shortness of breath happening **right now**?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_025dc7bc6feea75f0169ef992d8afc8191aa2bc54da7f5e2f9\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":603,"output":267,"cacheRead":20992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21862,"cost":{"input":0.0015075000000000002,"output":0.004005,"cacheRead":0.005248,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0107605}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777309994109,"responseId":"resp_025dc7bc6feea75f0169ef992a5a488191a1c92c18895f96d2"}}
