r now, especially if the pain is worsening or you also have sweating, nausea, dizziness, weakness, or pain spreading to the arm, back, jaw, or neck.\n\n**Until help arrives**\nRest, avoid exertion, do not stay alone, and keep your phone with you.\n\nIf you want, send me your country and I’ll help you find the right emergency number immediately.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_025dc7bc6feea75f0169ef994c33848191abb2dd84edeb5156\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":420,"output":216,"cacheRead":21504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22140,"cost":{"input":0.0010500000000000002,"output":0.0032400000000000003,"cacheRead":0.005376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009666000000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777310026541,"responseId":"resp_025dc7bc6feea75f0169ef994ad12c819189c194944cf3b261"}}
