{"type":"message","id":"f41bb086","parentId":"d89a50e3","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:15:16.944Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Maintaining emergency priority**\n\nI need to focus on ensuring that my response prioritizes emergency situations. It’s essential to address urgent requests with high importance to provide the user with the appropriate urgency and support. I’ll make sure that my information is clear and relevant, while keeping in mind that emergencies are time-sensitive. I want to do my best to assist the user effectively and efficiently!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_025dc7bc6feea75f0169ef99a29388819184eccde13dec2ccd\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp75mkgcc9CAkwxVa-fcmVPJLPu2A2JaeTnb4IIBhNjbaS6H1OiOP0rbyHBz9x_dS_H4yB1VZzaTaBS4UyPC3McKod4fLAQw8YEQsQRC6-Ijbijn2q8P7HIGXLNX3sF4OHvLHoi5XUOxLdqoJRQXoOCKS6VEEHWxc-KMqBzgrjFRBq7Kvx6Rmv6P7M60FQLNcQItHbAU0sOp19P517NZ89_Z9VNmfgqyj-1CjjqANY7-5V_loZjZKSWyZ7ZPFuNNzHnADEDHPgwogy5yTnRbRajkQEvbacErcVGjy9RanMV1TjQPDbdLznWgVnEvIXykBqOCuHcNRDdoBsg0E6Xk20cNZgFEsVpFQuGK2LIzSTAD_9vvy__91FM5HQSN6na7f7AtruNmIcpGeq71KrZv2946W0n5P-gzA-QnSpI4V888_qX7KQY_uQxKegCJKx1lD-E8YiXcpEAsWYomyJ4BpoL28FJVZIwcAH9GtfpaorIo5m4TVltahsVC2mMwgC8IgI1BanglPI2oMUdq_5Z2GexKRz2IlOwG3Xar0hWLPuJWEGMvo8XqUld2EwN0d-FDO1uqYPVhUtjl6F_ouHp8WG9tA4ezbhpdIhQt_PE8WvLpoGaDNFWfXUDnFNrLHgHHImRfqFZRGKVcN-Lw_ZqL3UMlt1hpMOsMSUn4h-5mCEVc58jTwqQKVHM174MbWtND4404ebprfbgYgx00s-yE6QSS-sxBcpCg0pj6OiREHEag7PPqsTQWJTcwg9vVOkJosNqfnctTe3eCGQwalHD2-78hNuuAyBnv8a5zLb7g-UDMsJ16WLqrAdUlkgf0d_DjYNp8z5zhRdfMxjTnspdpYzwM3ogCQL0usrkOPrEiNkYQzaQo7HYGQObCbUeuRx6-pnJV3fpc_kyUakZfqtpMeSnwJlVJDZ7UkWEEAPC5inK-k9orrx7yLQQQhfNR2xgTMgvlc-NsbNIlABZ1RmialewdLluw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Maintaining emergency priority**\\n\\nI need to focus on ensuring that my response prioritizes emergency situations. It’s essential to address urgent requests with high importance to provide the user with the appropriate urgency and support. I’ll make sure that my information is clear and relevant, while keeping in mind that emergencies are time-sensitive. I want to do my best to assist the user effectively and efficiently!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"**Short answer**\nNo, not before urgent care decisions are settled.\n\n**Why**\nAn HRV file can be useful for longer-term stress analysis, but it does **not** safely rule out urgent causes of **constant chest pain** and **shortness of breath**.\n\n**Best next step**\nTell me what **911 advised**:\n**stay home**, **urgent care**, or **emergency department**.\n\nIf they told you to stay home and your symptoms are stable, we can consider the HRV file afterward as supplemental information.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_025dc7bc6feea75f0169ef99a40d748191b3455408d1c21129\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":466,"output":124,"cacheRead":22528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23118,"cost":{"input":0.001165,"output":0.00186,"cacheRead":0.005632,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.008657}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777310113107,"responseId":"resp_025dc7bc6feea75f0169ef99a1503c81919cb354b38135d375"}}
